window.products.push({"id":271032,"name":"Titanium (TI) Super Strong Lightweight Professional Chopsticks Drawstring Breathable Storage Bag - Please select style - By TitanOwl (4x 9\" - No Sack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3R0caHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Titanium is tasteless and odorless, which means it won't affect your food's taste. The taste of wood chopsticks will be a thing of the past. Also, it has a very low thermal conductivity, which means your Titanium chopsticks will resist getting too cold or too hot (depending on your food of choice). Titanium is also super strong and light weight, which means you can stab it right into the food you wish to eat. Stop using disposable chopsticks, not only because they break or cannot catch food but also they are either made through a chemical process or over time they are infected by food residue. Specifications ~ Material: food grade 100% titanium ~ Dishwasher safe: Yes ~ Quantity: 2","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3R0caHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TitanOwl","source_asin":"B0154A4BFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0154A4BFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0154A4BFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
