window.products.push({"id":271048,"name":"Yifely Purple Butterfly Peel & Stick Shelf Drawer Liner PVC Nightstands Study Desk Tabletop Protective Paper 17.8 Inch by 9.8 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510BG1hib-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth. 5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.  This multi-purpose shelf paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cmLength: 3MPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL together in one parcel. Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface. Hope you can understand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510BG1hib-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B013X3VBOE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013X3VBOE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013X3VBOE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271049,"name":"Magnetic Vent Cover for Fireplace, Draft Stoppers, Black Magnet Sheets for Fireplace Vents - Black 2 PCs Each 4.75\" x 37\" Thickness: 30 mils - Insulat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e10w2+8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REMOVE BEFORE USING FIREPLACE!!!!! MUST BE REMOVED BEFORE STARTING FIRE!!! Flexible Black Magnetic Sheets Precut to Fit the Fireplace Vents and ready to install. Practical Magnetic Sheet Dimensions – Length 37 inch, Wide 4.75 inch, Thickness 30 mils. They are ready to be applied to the Fireplace Vents. Good holding power of 30 mil magnet makes these sheets adhere well and smooth to the vents of the fireplace. These magnetic sheets will keep the draft of cold air out of your house during cold weather and help you save on heating bill! The color of these magnetic sheets is plain black, they bland in with the fireplace color and do not stand out or shine, which makes them suitable for any home's decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e10w2+8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B086V29J54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086V29J54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086V29J54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
