window.products.push({"id":271069,"name":"Gorilla Grip Shaggy Chenille Bath Rug Mat for Toilet Base, Machine Wash, Microfiber Dries Quickly, Plush Absorbent Contour Mats for Toilets, Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610EE3nisqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Chenille Soft and Plush Chenille: pamper your feet with the softest, coziest chenille; thick and plush pile helps soothe feet and keeps toes warm from the cold floor below Rubber Backing: rug features a strong rubber backing, heavy duty stitching and durable binding for long lasting use Ultra Absorbent: our most absorbent bath rug; dense chenille pile captures extra moisture helping to keep your floors clean and dry; microfiber fabric dries quickly Perfect for Oval Toilet Bases: contour rug for around the oval base of your toilet measures 19.5 by 22.5 inches; measure your toilet base before purchase to ensure a perfect fit; see measuring guide in listing images Machine Washable: rugs are super easy to clean and fade resistant allowing you to machine wash and dry as often as needed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610EE3nisqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorilla Grip","source_asin":"B07W3Q7TBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W3Q7TBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W3Q7TBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271070,"name":"Colorful Metal Toothpick Set with 3 Reusable Tooth Picks, Waterproof Toothpick Holder, and Cleaning Brush - Sturdy Stainless Steel Metal Teeth Picks -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818D9ysAaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The EDC You’ll Never Want to Leave Home Without You’ve just finished gobbling up that hearty meal but you’re not desperately searching for a toothpick like before. That food stuck in your teeth isn’t driving you up the wall. Because you’ve got the C and C Adventures metal toothpick set in your pocket! It comes with 3 metal tooth picks, 1 carrying case, and 1 cleaning brush to keep the toothpick holder pristine. Tired of wooden toothpicks breaking and plastic ones bending? You’ve found picks that are crafted to practically last a lifetime. We’ve brought the metal teeth picks to life using food-grade stainless steel and made compliments an everyday affair with the multi-colored design. Sleek and elegant, this everyday carry turns the most mundane of activities into a polished statement. Product Specifications: ✔ Color: Multiple Colors ✔ Material: Stainless Steel ✔ Pick Dimensions: 2.6” (L) Inches ✔ Case Dimensions: 3.4” (L) x 0.38” (D) Inches Package Inclusions: ✔ 1 x Toothpick Holder ✔ 3 x Metal Toothpicks ✔ 1 x Cleaning Brush Discover A World of Versatility There’s more to this set than just clearing the evidence of your ravenous pursuits. You can use the metal toothpicks as unique cocktail fruit pickers for a touch of elegance, or as package openers that rip through tape & cardboard with ease. Look closer and you’ll see the secret behind our picks’ versatility. The ends are knurled for a great grip, while the tips are smooth enough to confidently use in your mouth yet fine enough to handle fruits and packages. And even when you’re in the middle of your camping trip, deep in the wilderness soaking up the great outdoors, the airtight seal on the waterproof carry case keeps your reusable toothpicks clean & dry. Happy picking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818D9ysAaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C and C Adventures","source_asin":"B07HM8LHYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HM8LHYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HM8LHYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271071,"name":"PoPoTo 8x36 Inch New Clear Plastic Desk Pad Dining Table Protector Tablecloth Mat Office Desk Blotter 1.5mm Thick Rectangular Waterproof Odorless No-S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wkHEX3z5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🆕【Upgraded Version Material】PoPoTo New Clear Table Cover Protector is made of premium eco-friendly PVC vinyl, which is no plastic smell and odorless with round corner design. The high transparent crystal table pad protector is ideal for kids, pregnant women or the elderly. The maximum heat resistant temperature of this clear table cover is 176°F/80°C, which better protect your tabletop from burns. It can be used as sofa table protector, candle tabletop cover, dining table protector. 🆕【Heavy Duty Tablecloth】1.5mm Thicken Clear Plastic Table Protective Pad is heavy duty and won't move easily. Durable crystal plastic tablecloth is waterproof, oil-proof, anti-coffee, anti-scratch, it is easy to clean and wipeable. The stain can be easily wiped off with damp paper towel or damp cloth. Protect your beautiful and expensive desktop well and keep it clean and tidy. It is a perfect table mat for coffee table, kitchen counter, bar, buffer, dinner table. 🆕【Application of Clear Table Mat】The Clear PVC Table Pad Mat Protector is prefect for Glass Wooden Marble Granite Table. It is suitable for our daily use as office writing desk pad, computer desk protector, TV table mat cover, dinner table protector, changing picnic table protector, conference table protector cover, pet feeding mat, gaming table cover, garage or chair floor mats. Make sure the applied oil is dry enough, before place the clear table protector on lacquered or polished wooden top. 🆕【Various Sizes & Shapes】Our Plastic Vinyl Table Mats Cover are Available in Various Sizes, and included Rectangular, Square or Round, you can choose according to your needs. Due to possible shrinkage and deviation, we have reserved a size slightly longer than the actual length of the clear plastic table pad cover. If you need to cut to fit, please use a pencil to make notes or match with a steel ruler firstly, and then use sharp scissors to cut. Please by it with confidence. 🆕【PoPoTo Guarantee & Tips】We will 100% guarantee service satisfaction that refund or replace, please feel free to contact us. As the new clear table protector pads are roller packed, so the table mats pads are a little wrinkled and warped edge. The solution is as follows: A. Heating it with a hair dryer to make it flat; B. Lay it in the sun for half an hour; C. Lay out in reverse-roll direction and put something heavy on the curled places; D. Use your iron on the curled places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wkHEX3z5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PoPoTo","source_asin":"B09D923DGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D923DGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D923DGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
