window.products.push({"id":271143,"name":"GENRRYHOME 48x36 inch LED Bathroom Wall Mounted Makeup Mirror - Anti Fog independently Controlled - Dimmer Function- 3000K-4500K-6000K High Lumen CRI ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofVM83nVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Dimmable]: Long press the open button,the light is available to be adjusted from 10% - 100% of brightness.Also you can short press the second button to select 3000K warm white, 4500K neutral white light or 6000K daylight. [Unique design]: The mirror anti-fog switch is independent design. Turn on the anti-fog switch when necessary, safe and energy-saving. This built in anti-fogging function means no need to constantly treat your mirrors with fog free spray. [Support Wall Switch Control]: wall switch can directly control the light ON/OFF.When the led mirror is powered off and restarted by wall switch, the last use state is restored. [Safe&lifetime]: UL-listed electronic parts, and covered by safety housing. IP54 rate to ensure safe lighting in wet bathroom environments.LED lifetime: over 50,000 hours (Using the mirror 3 hours a day means it will last 45 YEARS), Copper-free Silver Mirror ,much less corrosion rate compared with normal silver mirrors. [Packaging & easy installation]: Newly improved packing greatly reduces damage during transportation. GENRRYHOME led mirrors have passed all tests including dropping test, impact test, heavy pressure test etc. Screw mount included, easy to install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofVM83nVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENRRYHOME","source_asin":"B09CYH2284","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYH2284","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYH2284","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271144,"name":"Silikomart Silicone Fancy and Function Bakeware Collection Plumcake Pan, Ornamental","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dIERpRuEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Silikomart was established in 2002 as a product of the experience and belief of its founder Dario Martellato. Silikomart offers a wide range of refined and innovative products, with a functionality, practicality and beauty which meet the needs of all those who love to cook. The company has continuously strived to offer its customers a superior product. for this reason, the whole production process is \"MADE IN ITALY'', and uses the highest quality commercial silicone (made from 100-Percent platinum liquid silicone), which complies with FDA and CE food standards. Silikomart silicone products are completely non-toxic, odorless and tasteless and the liquid silicone injection process allows for incredibly detailed forms for baking pans and molds. This combination of quality, safety, and performance, along with their unique designs, makes Silikomart the leading specialist of culinary silicone use amongst professional pastry chefs. Silikomart silicone products are ultra flexible, they don't release smoke or odors when baking, and they are resistant to cracks and aging. They can be used directly from the freezer to the oven, from-75-Degree F to +450-Degree F, and they are dishwasher and microwave safe. Silikomart currently holds two patents: the Safe Ring is the ring designed to give greater stability to silicone molds, and Easy Cream, a technology developed to make ice cream on a stick with silicone molds. All silicone products are guaranteed for up to 3,000 uses. The Fancy and Function collection by Silikomart inspires your party time with style and imagination. Thanks to their diversity in shapes, the Fancy and Function collection 100-Percent food silicone molds are suitable for any festive occasion: birthdays, anniversaries, parties, etc. Both the cake pans and multiform molds are fitted with the patented Silikomart safe ring, the support ring that ensures stability to the mold as well as faultless and beautiful results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dIERpRuEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silikomart","source_asin":"B008ASWPT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008ASWPT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008ASWPT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
