window.products.push({"id":271233,"name":"BedsPick Weighted Blanket, Smaller Pockets (2 inchx2 inch), Twin Weighted Blanket with Lead-Free Glass Beads, 48\"x72\" 15 lbs, Suitable for Family Use ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j4nR7VP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BedsPick EXCLUSIVE EDITION】: 2”x2” smallest compartments for more equitable weight distribution. The only weighted blanket on the market with 2x2-inch smallest sections. It has the finest stitching (0.25mm per stitch) to avoid movement of weight between compartments. All of these attributes make it a superb blanket. 【New Sleep Technology】: Enjoy high-quality sleep with the help of technology. The Cooling weighted blanket weighs about 10% of the human body's weight, which improves sleep and reduces the number of waking up in the middle of the night. When you turn over, there is no noise to ensure your deep sleep. Suitable for all seasons 【Pet-Friendly & Best Gift】: Whether for cats or dogs, the cool weighted blanket is very firm and not easy to scratch. Coolmax weighted blanket has high-quality 100% microfiber fabric, not stuffy, safe for babies. Adult weighted blanket is made from a premium, super soft, and cozy Comfortable and breathable fabric. 【8 Durable Ties】: The weighted blanket with more extra-durable loops can be firmly fixed in place, you can easily add a duvet cover to the heavy blankets, without slipping. And this women weighted blanket can also be used alone-very user-friendly design 【Machine Washable】: Heavy weighted blanket can be washed in cold water and mild mode with cleaning bag, air-dried, very easy to maintain. 15lb weighted blanket for adult to relax your body. (Caring: Since this is weighted blanket, we hope you can give yourself 7-15 days to get used to it.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j4nR7VP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BedsPick","source_asin":"B09FLM2Q4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLM2Q4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLM2Q4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
