window.products.push({"id":271251,"name":"Wovanna Woven Black Placemats for Dining Table Set of 6 Thick Rustic Round Kitchen Placemats with Decorative Round Holder All Natural Wicker Tablemats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M4n7DvR+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% HANDMADE FROM NATURAL HYACINTH - On rare occasions, size may vary due to the nature of our placemats being handwoven. Add a little more soul to your tablescape – Brighten up your table with an environmentally-friendly upgrade - the Wovanna gorgeous set of 4 natural woven placemats, shipped right from sunny Santa Barbara, California, with love. Oozing sandy summer vibes stylish, rustic flair, each of our 11.8\" round wicker placemats features a stunning, versatile design. EXCLUSIVE: CHARMING HOLDER INCLUDED – When they’re not protecting precious table surfaces from heat, scratches, or damage, stack them happily together in one place! Yes, the Wovanna circle placemats rest in their own exquisite multipurpose holder. Get creative: use it as a tray, organizer or as an attractive decorative piece. Smart, fun, trendy, sustainable AND affordable, makes an irresistible addition to any country home, boho dining room, living room, cottage or cabin-themed interior décor METICULOUSLY HANDCRAFTED FROM THE HEART- Help us preserve craft traditions! Our talented artisans intricately weave pure fibers by hand, with exceptional attention to the tiniest detail until the clean, fresh braided texture becomes a superb set of 4 non-skid placemats with placemat holder. The thick, tight woven pattern is strong enough to survive years of daily dining AND special occasions - holidays, Christmas, Easter or Thanksgiving dinners, family get-togethers, and vibrant dinner parties MADE OF NATURALLY-GROWN WATER HYACINTH - To give a safer, healthier, eco-conscious feel to your favorite table setting, the Wovanna round natural placemats are beautifully handmade from water hyacinth - a weed famous for its massive power of growth, survival, and regeneration. Instead of allowing it to choke waterways, we turn it into the most environmentally-friendly alternative to conventional, planet-harming, synthetic table placemats. Kind, protective, resistant to heat, spills AND stains GORGEOUS READY-TO-BE-GIFTED PRESENTATION – Impress your loved ones and guests with premium, heartfelt eco-placemats! Never too coarse or hard, the magnificent, handwoven Wovanna rustic placemats for dining table make a divine housewarming, wedding, or birthday gift for keen hosts, couples, or friends. Sufficiently robust for a good wipe down, yet spectacularly pretty to add an effortlessly bohemian layer to table tops on special occasions, harvest-themed events, bridal or baby showers. Lovely!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M4n7DvR+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wovanna","source_asin":"B0C3X8PDGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3X8PDGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3X8PDGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
