window.products.push({"id":271297,"name":"bonVIVO Frida Cold Brew Coffee Maker, Cold Brew Maker For Coffee Lovers, Cold Coffee Maker With Permanent Filter And Glass Coffee Pot, Cold Brew Iced ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r3gI37w8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"&#10004 FOR COFFEE LOVERS: Make a trendy cold brewed coffee at home. Our cold brew coffee maker Frida brings that special aroma to your cup of coffee. Connoisseurs will appreciate the alternative to hot filter coffee, which can be brewed with this glass coffee pot and cold brew coffee filter. Cold-brew coffee is not only delicious, but also easy to digest. A journey into a world of undreamt-of flavors is about to open up for you. &#10004 FOR COFFEE LOVERS: Make a trendy cold brewed coffee at home. Our cold brew coffee maker Frida brings that special aroma to your cup of coffee. Connoisseurs will appreciate the alternative to hot filter coffee, which can be brewed with this glass coffee pot and cold brew coffee filter. Cold-brew coffee is not only delicious, but also easy to digest. A journey into a world of undreamt-of flavors is about to open up for you. &#10004 EASY TO USE: The coffee cold brew maker is simple to use. First grind about 6-8 teaspoons of your favorite coffee as coarsely as possible. Insert the stainless steel filter into the empty cold brew coffee pot. Pour in about 1/3 of the ground coffee. Next, add approx.1.5 cups of water, followed by the remaining ground coffee. Add another 580 ml of water until the coffee pot is almost full. Then put the cold coffee brewer in the fridge for 12 to 20 hours. Glass product: Handle with care. &#10004 BONVIVO QUALITY: We understand and appreciate the importance of good coffee, either in your routine, or to escape from it. We are pleased and excited to provide you with an elegant cold brew pitcher that is not only high-end with German QC, but also understands that \"quality\" is carried in the stainless steel and in the coffee. That's why we use the best products to produce each of our beautiful cold press coffee maker to ensure that every look, and every drop, pleases your tastes. &#10004 DESIGN & QUALITY: The cold brew coffee machine with filter is a minimalist design piece that radiates timeless elegance. The coffee pot is made of glass. In addition, our ice coffee makers have a strainer insert that is made of stainless steel. This permanent filter provides an incomparable aroma. The coffee glass pot doesn't have a bulky handle - this provides more space in the refrigerator. The black rubber band around the glass coffee maker ensures a secure grip. &#10004 INCLUDED IN THE DELIVERY: Our cold-brew coffee makers include: 1 glass container with 34 oz capacity. This is about 8 cups. 1 stainless steel lid and 1 removable long sieve made of stainless steel. HINT: Take a look at our matching cooling rod for our cold-brew coffee pods. This ensures that the delicious cold brew stays cool and fresh for up to three hours longer in the cold brew coffee carafe. Enjoy your cup of cold brewed coffee with our cold brew coffee brewer Frida!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r3gI37w8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bonVIVO","source_asin":"B0744HP1NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0744HP1NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0744HP1NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
