window.products.push({"id":271600,"name":"BicycleStore Pour Over Coffee Maker, Paperless Glass Carafe with Glass Filter Cup, Reusable Glass Coffee Pot Manual Coffee Dripper Brewer Hand Drip wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8w-TwP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"600ml High Quality Coffee Pot -- This body of hand drip coffee pot is made of environmentally-friendly borosilicate glass, which can withstand high temperatures without cracking, no strange smell, quite durable, perfect for long use. Glass Filter Cup and 50 Pieces Big Filter Paper -- Comes with a filter cup with a black holder, and 50 pieces big corrugated filter paper, dual filter can greatly prevent coffee grounds from entering the cup and ensure you can enjoy the most delicious coffee. Certainly you can also just use filter cup. A good substitute for disposable filters, no waste and environmental-friendly. Easy to Clean -- Both the filter cup and the filter cup holder can be easily removed, smooth glass inner is convenient to be washed by water, the outside of this coffee pot can be cleaned with a wet cloth, which can save a lot time, you can enjoy the coffee time without much worries. Easy to Use -- You just need to put the filter and filter paper on the coffeemaker pots, add your favorite coffee, slowly pour hot water and stir, then you can get a cup of delicious coffee. And the wooden handle can protect your hands from getting burned, convenient and safe. Enjoy Your Coffe Time -- This pour over coffee maker allows you to diy your coffee as your needs, you can adjust the concentration and temperature yourself, or add some other drinks, it is perfect for family, office time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r8w-TwP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BicycleStore","source_asin":"B0BG6VWH87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG6VWH87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG6VWH87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271601,"name":"Hummingbird with Hydrangeas Decorative Craft Trinket Metal Tin Box Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61egvhTSHLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Admit it. You're kind of sentimental and you've been longing for a fun spot to store your treasured trinkets. It doesn't have to be anything big or fancy, but a boring box just won't do. And now you've finally found something just right in this set of two, small Made On Terra decorative tins. The lid is printed with a fun design that expresses you just so and it comes off easily to reveal a small space to keep your cool stuff. It's simple, but perfect. You know that the tins also make great packaging for gift cards, jewelry or other small gifts, but you're not sure you're willing to give them up just yet. No one would blame you for that. Made of light-weight metal, the Made On Terra decorative tin will store your trinkets with style. Choose from Made on Terra's many fun tins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61egvhTSHLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Made On Terra","source_asin":"B00KVQTJO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KVQTJO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KVQTJO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":271602,"name":"Gonesh Everyday Strawberry Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oaQxov7aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GONESH EVERYDAY Because life doesn't wait for special occasions. Here's to everyday! To the little things that matter, and matter most. Your personal routine. Your daily rituals. Your ongoing obsessions and quirky habits. You don't need a special occasion to make everyday special, it already is!A light, gentle fragrance outburst from the makers of Gonesh Extra Rich Incense. An incense that truly mixes well with every day. Whether it's bust or robust. Life goes on. Stick with it. About our Incense: Gonesh continually strives to elevate the level of fragrance delivery by working with creative and skilled perfumers, by using the highest quality raw materials, and by our exclusive use of High Charcoal. Unlike wood powder, charcoal produces no smoke- allowing the fragrant oil to vaporize and the scent to come through without smoke. Gonesh Incense has the highest charcoal content of any brand currently on the market - it delivers the purest, cleanest burn, and crystal clear fragrances. About our Company: We're out to change the image of incense in America. By operating in the bustling city of Chicago, we can guarantee that our incense is high quality, ethically sourced and environmentally responsible. Today Genieco's Gonesh brand includes a variety of \"green\" and Earth-friendly practices, including a recent installation of Solar Panels on our warehouse rooftop. We take great pride in supporting green energy and do our part in reducing our carbon footprint. DIRECTIONS: Hold a lighted match to the coated end of a stick until it glows; blow out flame. Place sticks in an incense holder, a flowerpot, or a glass filled with salt, sand or earth. Be sure that the ashes fall on a fireproof surface. WARNING: Keep burning stick away from flammable articles such as papers, drapes, etc. Do not allow sticks to touch any varnished, painted, plastic, etc. surfaces. Never leave burning incense unattended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oaQxov7aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gonesh","source_asin":"B07JVPG358","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JVPG358","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JVPG358","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
