window.products.push({"id":271898,"name":"Chef Grade, Elegant 8x4in 1Lb Paper Loaf Pans 10 Pack. Best Disposable, Bakeable Kraft Pan Supply for Baking Bread, Small Meatloaf, Lemon Bundt Cake, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710aeQrBPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the ultimate baked goods with our super durable and beautiful loaf pans that are trusted by caterers and chefs the world over! Our commercial grade loaf pans are the perfect kitchen supply for top bakers and home cooks. Plus, they're the perfect size for holding your favorite treats! Great for storing and freezing, too Don't worry about using separate containers and bags for baking, storing, freezing and microwaving. Our paper pans hold up just as well in fridges, freezers and microwaves. Simply cover in plastic wrap and store them anywhere, or display at your bake sale or fundraiser. Plus, they stack easily and tightly when not in use for space saving storage in pantries or dry storage. 100% safe for food for your peace of mind Our heavy duty, artisan pans are BPA free and completely food safe, so you know that the food you're serving won't harm your family, friends or loved ones. Each individual pan is completely safe for baking and serving casserole, carrot cake or pastry. Super portable to bring to your favorite events Don't worry about leaving your expensive cookware at bake sales, fundraisers or parties. Our super portable tins are the perfect accessories for any event that needs baked goods! Bring them to Thanksgiving and Christmas holiday potlucks, too. What’s in the box? One pack of 10 (ten) professional quality, corrugated cardboard baking pans for roasting and baking. Each pan is approx. 8\"x4\" at top, 7\"x3\" at base, and 2 inches deep. Liners not included - spray with oil or line with parchment for best results. Buy in bulk to save money for your next baking project! Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710aeQrBPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avant Grub","source_asin":"B08RQHGBP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RQHGBP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RQHGBP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
