window.products.push({"id":271969,"name":"Wood Stove Fan, 8 Blade Double Motors Heat Powered Stove Fan Small Silent Fireplace Fan Log Burner Fan Blower Top Exhaust Eco Fans for Wood Burner/Bur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610fwQvDUiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖8 BLADE TWIN MOTOR: Compact size-8 x 4.7 x 2.1 inches.Upgrade 8 blades wood stove fan, double motors.This heat powered stove fan with 8 blades circulates more warm air than standard 4-blade fan.Working with a temperature between 50(122℉) centigrade degree to400 centigrade degree. Can withstand high temperatures up to 752°F (400°C). Working noise of the wood stove fan is <25dB. 💖ECO-FRIENDLY : No batteries or electricity required, eco-friendly.The wood stove fan heat powered will help reduce the fuel consumption and make the room warmer quickly. As the stove warms up, the wood fireplace stove Eco fan runs faster and faster, distributing the heat to the far corners of the room.A magnetic stove thermometer included measures operating temperature to keep your stove safe. 💖LONGER WORKING LIFE: The whole wood burning stove fan is made from anodized aluminum, which is rust-proof, wear-resisting, with good thermal conductivity ,not be deformed or discoloured and can withstand high temperatures up to 752°F (400°C). The heat-powered stove fan has a higher thermal conductivity efficiency than those steel ones. 💖SILENT OPERATION: Working noise of the fireplace fans is <25dB.The 8 blades wood burning stove fan has a design of high temperature resistant and silent motor, electric ceramic sheet, and thickened large air volume fan blade. And even at top speed, there is hardly a whisper. 💖APPLICATION:Heat powered stove fan is widely used in wood stove, gas stove, Log Burner, Fireplace etc. Wood stove fan for heat powered stove,gets power from the heat poduced by your fireplace, wood-burning stove or pellet stove. 💖WOOD STOVE FAN NON ELECTRIC :The log burner fan speed automatically adjusting according to the temperature of the stove, It and stop as the fireplace cools. The higher temperature of the stove, the faster the blades spin. 💖OVERHEATING PROTECTION: the in-built bi-metallic strip at the base of the wood stove fan is designed the safety device gently elevates the front of the fan as the maximum operating temperature is approached to protect the motor . 💖EASY TO USE: No installation required, you only need to place the fan for wood burning stove on a smooth flat surface of your stove top, near the side or back of the stovepipe. Height only 13 cm to fit narrow spaces. 💖Our Eco fans have been tested in the harshest winters and come with a 2 year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610fwQvDUiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rozbolovin","source_asin":"B09BJKP35H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-271969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BJKP35H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BJKP35H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
